1
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:05,550
text

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,770
text

3
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:14,100
text

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,460
text

5
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,840
text

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,600
text

7
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:39,890
show title

8
00:00:41,867 --> 00:00:46,000
[This drama is fictional, and any resemblance
to real people or events is coincidental.]

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,200
[Final Episode]

10
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:20,867
Ye Rim, you came?

11
00:01:20,867 --> 00:01:22,833
Why are you so late?

12
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:26,833
I've been waiting so long.

13
00:01:37,267 --> 00:01:40,833
<i>Chairman is alive.</i>

14
00:01:40,833 --> 00:01:43,700
<i>But he doesn't recognize me.</i>

15
00:01:52,967 --> 00:01:55,000
Were you waiting for me?

16
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,333
Of course.

17
00:01:57,333 --> 00:01:59,550
It's my daughter after 20 years.

18
00:01:59,550 --> 00:02:02,030
Of course, I'd wait.

19
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,733
Ye Rim.

20
00:02:07,267 --> 00:02:12,700
You have no idea how lonely
I've been living in this house, huh?

21
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:16,600
From now on, I'll stay by your side, Dad.

22
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:19,800
Good. I appreciate that.

23
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:24,733
But if you're living here, beware of Seon Yeong.

24
00:02:24,733 --> 00:02:28,600
Never go near her.

25
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:33,900
Make sure she doesn't notice you. Got it?

26
00:02:44,867 --> 00:02:47,100
Why Seon Yeong?

27
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:53,833
She's only after my fortune.

28
00:02:53,833 --> 00:02:59,633
If she learns you're inheriting
everything from me,

29
00:02:59,633 --> 00:03:03,667
she won't leave you alone.

30
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,933
Okay.

31
00:03:07,167 --> 00:03:08,767
I'll follow your advice.

32
00:03:08,767 --> 00:03:10,733
Good.

33
00:03:10,733 --> 00:03:16,133
You truly are my only blood.

34
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:22,800
You're fundamentally different
from these money-hungry people.

35
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:29,900
Everyone in this house is a monster.

36
00:03:31,533 --> 00:03:33,333
Monsters?

37
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:38,500
Seon Yeong is terrifying.

38
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:41,100
So scary.

39
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,833
But

40
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,600
that Seon Yeong,

41
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,533
she's a pitiful child.

42
00:03:56,130 --> 00:04:00,067
Her father's death

43
00:04:01,330 --> 00:04:06,467
was actually caused by her mother
for the inheritance.

44
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:09,600
On a rainy day,

45
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:13,733
she hired someone to kill him

46
00:04:13,733 --> 00:04:16,300
at the fishing spot.

47
00:04:19,233 --> 00:04:21,733
Ever since then,

48
00:04:22,530 --> 00:04:25,833
she grew up

49
00:04:25,833 --> 00:04:30,467
without a single kind word

50
00:04:30,467 --> 00:04:35,267
or warm look from her mother.

51
00:04:35,267 --> 00:04:38,100
How pitiful.

52
00:04:39,367 --> 00:04:41,400
Pitiful?

53
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:47,033
How dare you say 'pitiful'?

54
00:04:48,933 --> 00:04:53,267
It was disgusting enough
that Lee Seon Yeong became Ga Seon Yeong.

55
00:04:53,267 --> 00:04:55,433
Say it again, huh?

56
00:04:55,433 --> 00:04:57,867
Wait, Ye Rim. Why are you acting like this?

57
00:04:57,867 --> 00:05:00,867
Ye Rim, Ye Rim, Ye Rim!

58
00:05:00,867 --> 00:05:03,267
Why keep calling a dead girl's name?

59
00:05:03,267 --> 00:05:06,900
Who died? Ye Rim. Who's dead?

60
00:05:10,033 --> 00:05:14,800
The Ga family members
should've been eliminated from the start.

61
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:18,033
You were just a factory manager.

62
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:21,433
How dare you pity anyone?

63
00:05:27,267 --> 00:05:28,967
Ga Sung Ho.

64
00:05:31,033 --> 00:05:34,200
Know my biggest regret?

65
00:05:35,233 --> 00:05:38,233
When you married Mom,

66
00:05:38,933 --> 00:05:41,833
I should've killed you then.

67
00:05:42,930 --> 00:05:46,033
None of this would've happened.

68
00:05:46,033 --> 00:05:47,600
Ye Rim.

69
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,500
I told you not to say that name!

70
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,800
You're already dead. Dying again won't matter.

71
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:00,967
Ye Rim. What's wrong with you?

72
00:06:00,967 --> 00:06:03,830
Why act like that wretched Seon Yeong?

73
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:06,700
Like that wretched woman.

74
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:08,833
Wretched woman?

75
00:06:10,467 --> 00:06:15,367
I'll let you meet
the Ye Rim you're desperately seeking.

76
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:19,400
Shut your filthy mouth!

77
00:06:31,267 --> 00:06:33,767
Ye Rim.

78
00:06:34,867 --> 00:06:38,233
Ye Rim's gone. I killed her.

79
00:06:38,233 --> 00:06:42,100
I personally choked your daughter to death.

80
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:44,267
Just like I'm killing you.

81
00:06:54,267 --> 00:06:56,667
Seon Yeong.

82
00:06:57,930 --> 00:07:00,500
Thank you.

83
00:07:03,167 --> 00:07:05,433
'Thank you'?

84
00:07:05,433 --> 00:07:07,500
You lunatic.

85
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:10,267
Die, you insufferable creature!

86
00:07:10,267 --> 00:07:12,067
Die!

87
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,867
Dad.

88
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:56,367
I need your fingerprint.

89
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:00,900
[Will]

90
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:18,860
...

91
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:20,867
Chairman.

92
00:09:20,867 --> 00:09:22,833
Oh, no.

93
00:09:24,267 --> 00:09:26,233
Chairman.

94
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:32,167
Chairman, wake up.

95
00:09:32,167 --> 00:09:34,333
Chairman.

96
00:09:35,333 --> 00:09:37,400
What do we do?

97
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,067
Darn it!

98
00:09:39,067 --> 00:09:41,167
-Ga Seon Yeong!
-Chairman.

99
00:09:41,167 --> 00:09:43,567
Ga Seon Yeong!

100
00:09:45,367 --> 00:09:49,433
Attorney Lee, call an ambulance.

101
00:09:50,167 --> 00:09:53,133
Can't do that.

102
00:09:53,967 --> 00:09:56,033
What do you mean?

103
00:09:56,600 --> 00:10:01,000
Chairman's already deceased.

104
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,333
What does that matter?

105
00:10:04,333 --> 00:10:06,767
Forgive me, Madam.

106
00:10:06,767 --> 00:10:08,000
Give me the phone.

107
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,533
Give me the phone!

108
00:10:09,533 --> 00:10:11,467
- Give me the phone!
- Madam.

109
00:10:11,467 --> 00:10:14,100
Please, please.

110
00:10:14,833 --> 00:10:16,633
What should I do?

111
00:10:33,233 --> 00:10:35,100
Oh, what should I do?

112
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:37,533
Chairman.

113
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:42,933
Chairman, what should I do?

114
00:10:42,933 --> 00:10:45,133
Chairman.

115
00:10:46,967 --> 00:10:51,867
Chairman, please open your eyes.

116
00:10:51,867 --> 00:10:55,000
Chairman. Oh God, what should I do?

117
00:10:57,833 --> 00:11:00,633
Chairman.

118
00:11:46,267 --> 00:11:52,433
We've temporarily moved Chairman
to Gaseong Hospital's mortuary.

119
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:03,267
We failed to protect Chairman.

120
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:08,933
Madam.

121
00:12:09,733 --> 00:12:14,467
It must be so hard for you,
but you need to pull yourself together.

122
00:12:14,467 --> 00:12:17,467
We still have work to do.

123
00:12:17,467 --> 00:12:20,933
The shareholders' meeting is about to begin.

124
00:12:23,067 --> 00:12:24,967
Understood.

125
00:12:29,433 --> 00:12:34,433
Jeon Dong Min is waiting outside.
Would you like to see him?

126
00:12:55,833 --> 00:12:57,367
Oh, Don.

127
00:12:57,367 --> 00:12:59,800
Is something wrong with Ms. Yeong Ran?

128
00:13:01,367 --> 00:13:03,833
You should go back to Muchang.

129
00:13:03,833 --> 00:13:06,700
Don't ask anything for now.

130
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:08,900
That's how you can help.

131
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:28,100
[Jeon Dong Min]

132
00:13:52,533 --> 00:13:57,233
<i>Ms. Yeong Ran, contact me anytime
if you need anything.</i>

133
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:17,233
Dong Min!

134
00:14:17,933 --> 00:14:19,067
Mi Seon!

135
00:14:19,067 --> 00:14:21,100
You've been through a lot, huh? Good job.

136
00:14:21,100 --> 00:14:22,467
Eat quickly.

137
00:14:22,467 --> 00:14:23,500
What is this?

138
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:25,400
Tofu. You've got to do what needs to be done.

139
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:28,967
Eat it all, and you'll never go
near the police station again, hurry.

140
00:14:28,967 --> 00:14:32,633
- All of this?
- It's not that much.

141
00:14:32,633 --> 00:14:33,800
But where's Ju Won?

142
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:36,333
Huh? Where'd he go?

143
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:38,200
He was here just a minute ago.

144
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,367
I'll go look for Ju Won.

145
00:14:39,367 --> 00:14:42,100
Wait, no. This...

146
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:46,333
Dong Min, eat the tofu before it gets cold.

147
00:14:46,333 --> 00:14:48,533
Jeon Ju Won.

148
00:14:48,533 --> 00:14:50,367
Jeon Ju Won!

149
00:15:04,933 --> 00:15:09,533
Dad's here, but Ju Won isn't,

150
00:15:09,533 --> 00:15:12,233
so I guess I have to go back to Seoul.

151
00:15:12,233 --> 00:15:13,700
No!

152
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:16,100
Dad!

153
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:26,033
Dad, where are you going again?

154
00:15:26,033 --> 00:15:27,433
I'm sorry.

155
00:15:27,433 --> 00:15:29,433
Did you wait long for me?

156
00:15:29,433 --> 00:15:30,867
A bit.

157
00:15:30,867 --> 00:15:34,000
You must've been busy too, Dad.

158
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,900
Jeon Ju Won.

159
00:15:35,900 --> 00:15:37,633
You've grown so much since I last saw you.

160
00:15:37,633 --> 00:15:39,400
Dad.

161
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:42,200
I look like an elementary school kid now, right?

162
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:44,767
Not like a kindergartener, right?

163
00:15:46,733 --> 00:15:48,533
Well.

164
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:52,400
I'll ask Miss when she comes back.

165
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:57,600
Dad, when will Miss come back?

166
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:06,533
She has lots of things to finish.

167
00:16:06,533 --> 00:16:10,367
She'll come back after finishing them.

168
00:16:10,933 --> 00:16:12,800
When?

169
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:18,667
She still needs some time.

170
00:16:20,233 --> 00:16:22,433
But in my opinion,

171
00:16:22,433 --> 00:16:24,867
she will definitely come back.

172
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:28,400
I don't believe you, Dad.

173
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:31,967
Just because you grew taller,
you don't believe your dad?

174
00:16:31,967 --> 00:16:34,567
I never believed you even before.

175
00:16:34,567 --> 00:16:36,900
Look at this kid.

176
00:16:43,433 --> 00:16:46,000
I'm sorry.

177
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,233
I'll try to be a better dad.

178
00:16:49,233 --> 00:16:50,500
Well,

179
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:56,367
then I'll try to be a better son too.

180
00:17:07,567 --> 00:17:09,867
Madam, we have a problem.

181
00:17:09,867 --> 00:17:14,233
The secret study's CCTV wasn't recording either.

182
00:17:14,233 --> 00:17:15,667
What do you mean?

183
00:17:15,667 --> 00:17:18,267
There's absolutely no footage.

184
00:17:57,333 --> 00:18:00,033
Professor, you look beautiful today.

185
00:18:06,333 --> 00:18:07,033
[The 20th Gaseong Group Shareholders' Meeting]

186
00:18:07,033 --> 00:18:10,033
We now begin the 20th
Gaseong Group Shareholders' Meeting.

187
00:18:10,033 --> 00:18:14,667
We'll proceed with the vote for
Director Ga Seon Yeong's chairmanship appointment.

188
00:18:14,667 --> 00:18:16,633
[Kim Yeong Ran]

189
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:32,467
What's happening?

190
00:18:33,833 --> 00:18:35,400
Executive Director.

191
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:37,867
You need to see this message.

192
00:18:42,967 --> 00:18:47,867
[Will]

193
00:18:48,767 --> 00:18:51,433
What's the meaning of this, Executive Director?

194
00:18:51,433 --> 00:18:55,933
So Kim Yeong Ran presented a fake will?

195
00:18:55,933 --> 00:19:00,133
Whose will is the real one?

196
00:19:03,433 --> 00:19:05,333
We'll see.

197
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:08,100
Kim Yeong Ran isn't even here.

198
00:19:08,100 --> 00:19:13,600
I have no idea what's going on.

199
00:19:15,533 --> 00:19:16,267
[The 20th Gaseong Group Shareholders' Meeting]
At today's 20th Gaseong Group
shareholders' meeting,

200
00:19:16,267 --> 00:19:19,733
At today's 20th Gaseong Group
shareholders' meeting, $

201
00:19:19,733 --> 00:19:21,800
if more than 20 out of the 40
attending directors vote in favor,

202
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:27,000
Director Ga Seon Yeong will be elected
as Gaseong Group's second chairman.

203
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,767
Now, let's see the results.

204
00:19:29,767 --> 00:19:31,233
[30 Approve, 8 Reject]

205
00:19:31,233 --> 00:19:35,567
With 30 approvals,
8 rejections, and 2 abstentions,

206
00:19:35,567 --> 00:19:38,533
having surpassed
the majority of attending directors,

207
00:19:38,533 --> 00:19:43,533
Director Ga Seon Yeong is elected
as the second chairman of Gaseong Group.

208
00:19:46,067 --> 00:19:48,733
Congratulations on becoming
the new Chairman of Gaseong Group.

209
00:19:48,733 --> 00:19:51,467
Please say a few words.

210
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,733
Thank you.

211
00:19:56,733 --> 00:19:58,940
The foundation of Gaseong Group
was Minjeong Foods,

212
00:19:58,940 --> 00:20:02,367
created by my mother, Lee Min Jeong.

213
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:09,133
She always promised to pass
Minjeong Foods down to me.

214
00:20:10,667 --> 00:20:14,433
My apologies. We seem to have audio issues.

215
00:20:19,533 --> 00:20:21,033
<i>Tonight is</i>

216
00:20:21,033 --> 00:20:27,633
<i>September 26th, 2025, 9 PM.</i>

217
00:20:27,633 --> 00:20:30,333
<i>I'm Ga Sung Ho.</i>

218
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,967
<i>I'm not dead.</i>

219
00:20:34,967 --> 00:20:37,933
<i>The reason I'm still holding on</i>

220
00:20:37,933 --> 00:20:41,733
<i>is to clear the injustice
done to my daughter Ye Rim,</i>

221
00:20:41,733 --> 00:20:45,067
<i>who died 15 years ago.</i>

222
00:20:45,067 --> 00:20:49,467
<i>The killer who murdered my daughter Ye Rim</i>

223
00:20:49,467 --> 00:20:52,733
<i>will reveal themselves soon.</i>

224
00:20:52,733 --> 00:20:54,367
Turn it off now!

225
00:20:56,767 --> 00:20:59,433
[Control Room]

226
00:20:59,433 --> 00:21:01,833
Open the door. Open the door.

227
00:21:05,733 --> 00:21:07,367
Open the door!

228
00:21:09,133 --> 00:21:11,933
<i>Ye Rim's gone.</i>

229
00:21:11,933 --> 00:21:14,567
<i>I killed her.</i>

230
00:21:14,567 --> 00:21:19,000
<i>I personally choked your daughter to death.</i>

231
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:25,233
That, that is...

232
00:21:25,233 --> 00:21:27,967
Chairman, Chairman.

233
00:21:54,467 --> 00:21:55,733
Ms. Ga Seon Yeong.

234
00:21:55,733 --> 00:21:58,500
You're under arrest for the murder of Ga Sung Ho.

235
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:08,300
<i>Wait.</i>

236
00:22:10,133 --> 00:22:11,800
<i>Wait.</i>

237
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:32,267
<i>Gaseong Group Chairman Ga Sung Ho was alive.</i>

238
00:22:32,267 --> 00:22:34,300
<i>What?</i>

239
00:22:34,300 --> 00:22:36,367
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

240
00:22:36,367 --> 00:22:38,567
<i>But he was murdered last night.</i>

241
00:22:38,567 --> 00:22:40,033
<i>What?</i>

242
00:22:40,033 --> 00:22:42,533
<i>This is the evidence.</i>

243
00:22:55,700 --> 00:22:59,100
You have the right to remain silent.

244
00:22:59,933 --> 00:23:03,570
If you lay a single finger on me,
you're all dead,

245
00:23:03,570 --> 00:23:05,430
got it?

246
00:23:13,300 --> 00:23:18,567
Kim Yeong Ran. You think I'd fall for such an amateur trap?

247
00:23:19,233 --> 00:23:23,167
I'll make it very clear that you're nothing.

248
00:23:27,467 --> 00:23:30,900
This is your end, Ga Seon Yeong.

249
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:52,930
[Gaseong Group]

250
00:23:52,933 --> 00:23:55,167
I'm Kim Yeong Ran.

251
00:23:56,430 --> 00:24:01,833
The will Ga Seon Yeong shared today is fake.

252
00:24:03,700 --> 00:24:05,967
The genuine will names me

253
00:24:05,967 --> 00:24:09,300
as Gaseong Group's successor,

254
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:13,067
but I choose to decline this inheritance.

255
00:24:13,067 --> 00:24:15,567
I propose that Gaseong Group's management

256
00:24:15,567 --> 00:24:19,967
be entrusted to Executive Park Yong Guk,

257
00:24:21,433 --> 00:24:26,300
who worked with Chairman Ga Sung Ho
since Minjeong Foods' early days.

258
00:24:28,733 --> 00:24:30,033
Additionally,

259
00:24:30,033 --> 00:24:33,867
I demand a complete overhaul
of the board of directors,

260
00:24:33,867 --> 00:24:38,567
which is riddled with various corruption,
as the majority shareholder.

261
00:24:38,567 --> 00:24:40,600
This is ridiculous!

262
00:24:43,800 --> 00:24:46,933
Finally, I have a few words to say.

263
00:24:47,467 --> 00:24:49,600
Gaseong Group

264
00:24:49,600 --> 00:24:52,100
and Red Ramyeon

265
00:24:56,533 --> 00:25:00,600
were Chairman Ga Sung Ho's life's work.

266
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:08,067
Please remember his dedication

267
00:25:09,067 --> 00:25:14,667
and genuine efforts.

268
00:25:36,900 --> 00:25:39,000
[Director Ga Seon Yeong Arrested for Murder]
<i>GNA Exclusive Breaking News.</i>

269
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:42,433
<i>Chairman Ga Sung Ho, previously
reported to have died by gunshot suicide,</i>

270
00:25:42,433 --> 00:25:44,933
