271
00:25:44,933 --> 00:25:46,433
<i>However, last week,</i>

272
00:25:46,433 --> 00:25:49,833
<i>he was allegedly murdered
by his stepdaughter Professor Ga Seon Yeong,</i>

273
00:25:49,833 --> 00:25:51,400
<i>shocking the public.</i>

274
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:53,148
<i>During Gaseong Group's</i>

275
00:25:53,148 --> 00:25:55,933
[Video of the murder of Chairman Ga was released]
<i>first shareholder meeting after the funeral,</i>

276
00:25:55,933 --> 00:25:58,833
<i>as Professor Ga Seon Yeong
was being elected as new CEO...</i>

277
00:25:58,833 --> 00:26:00,367
Ga Seon Yeong.

278
00:26:00,367 --> 00:26:03,267
She's been arrested for Ga Sung Ho's murder.

279
00:26:03,267 --> 00:26:06,800
The evidence is solid. There's no escaping this.

280
00:26:06,800 --> 00:26:10,000
Mr. Ham Hyeon Woo. If Ga Seon Yeong gets arrested,

281
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:13,133
