282
00:26:14,600 --> 00:26:18,267
Did you order Gil Ho Se to orchestrate
Ga Seon Woo and Kim Yeong Ran's murders?

283
00:26:18,267 --> 00:26:20,733
Was it you?

284
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:28,600
You saw the footage.

285
00:26:28,600 --> 00:26:31,233
Confess willingly.

286
00:26:31,233 --> 00:26:34,367
Patricide carries severe penalties.

287
00:26:34,367 --> 00:26:38,967
Staying silent won't help
