295
00:27:29,867 --> 00:27:31,467
Attorney Lee.

296
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:36,667
Did you know all about Chairman's plans?

297
00:27:38,867 --> 00:27:42,800
I never imagined he'd go this far.

298
