320
00:29:14,767 --> 00:29:19,333
Therefore, we request Ms. Kim Yeong Ran
to testify regarding this case.

321
00:29:19,333 --> 00:29:20,867
What's going on?

322
00:29:20,867 --> 00:29:22,800
Your Honor, I object.

323
00:29:22,800 --> 00:29:24,700
