324
00:29:24,700 --> 00:29:26,733
Even without prior agreement,

325
00:29:26,733 --> 00:29:32,700
I'll allow the witness testimony
due to its critical importance.

326
00:29:36,767 --> 00:29:40,433
-You were present at Ga Seon Woo's murder scene?
-Yes.

327
00:29:40,433 --> 00:29:42,067
Real name Gil Tae,

328
00:29:42,067 --> 00:29:44,233
